    "https://jobs.oakland.edu/postings/39040": {
      "title": "Meadow Brook Estate Groundskeeper",
      "description": "Oakland University Employment Site | Meadow Brook Estate Groundskeeper Skip to Main Content Employment Opportunities Toggle navigation Home Search Jobs Log In /Create Account Help Human Resources Benefits Campus Map Student Employment Meadow Brook Estate Groundskeeper Bookmark this Requisition Print Preview | Apply for this Job Posting Details Posting Details Position Title Meadow Brook Estate Groundskeeper Department 3760 - Meadow Brook Estate Position Number D43727 Requisition No. TC06532 Salary Range/Pay Rate $16.00/hour Benefits of Working at Oakland University No benefits are associated with this casual position. Employee Group/Grade Casual Job Category Casual /Temporary Casual/Temp Classification Work Schedule Casual (19hrs or less, No Benefits ) Shift/Days Seasonal Position, October 1st – January 31st Pay Schedule Hour Number of Hrs./Wk. Up to 19 hours per week Position Information Position Information Employee's Effective Start Date 09/14/2026 If this is a Temporary position, provide end date or enter N/A for any other position type. N/A Minimum Qualifications High school graduation or equivalent. Ability to read directions and written instructions. Performs physically active work requiring frequent standing, reaching, walking, bending, shoveling, pushing, climbing on a ladder and lifting in order to perform various grounds and event operations tasks. Frequent lifting requiring the execution of up to sixty pounds of force to move and use supplies, landscaping materials, grounds equipment. Completion of an employment physical to verify the applicant’s ability to perform the duties of the position is required. Work with fertilizers and other substances that may produce strong and/or offensive odors and works in various conditions with extremes in the heat and cold. A valid Michigan driver’s license, a driving record acceptable to the University and a criminal background check are required. Desired Qualifications Grounds keeping/irrigation/landscape experience Position Purpose Assist with Winter Wonder Lights and seasonal holiday light displays. Maintain the estate grounds at Meadow Brook Hall. May assist with duties of operations unit. Job Duties Part-time groundskeeper is responsible for tasks such as mowing, string trimming, picking up trash, planting flowers, utilizing various types of grounds equipment. Managing supplies, irrigation and overall maintenance of the estate grounds. This position also assists with set up and removal Winter Wonder Lights and seasonal holiday light displays Job Open Date 09/15/2026 Job Close Date Open Until Filled No Position Specific Questions Required fields are indicated with an asterisk (*). Documents Needed to Apply Required Documents Optional Documents 371 Wilson Boulevard, Rochester, MI 48309 248-370-2100     To ensure the security of your data, you will be logged out due to inactivity in 3 minutes at . Any data not saved will be lost. Click 'OK' to keep your session active."
