    "https://jobs.oakland.edu/postings/38085": {
      "title": "Athletics Public Address (PA) Announcer",
      "description": "Oakland University Employment Site | Athletics Public Address (PA) Announcer Skip to Main Content Employment Opportunities Toggle navigation Home Search Jobs Log In /Create Account Help Human Resources Benefits Campus Map Student Employment Athletics Public Address (PA) Announcer Bookmark this Requisition Print Preview | Apply for this Job Posting Details Posting Details Position Title Athletics Public Address (PA) Announcer Department 2836 - Athletics Administration Position Number E44249 Requisition No. TC06429 Salary Range/Pay Rate 15.00 hr. Benefits of Working at Oakland University No benefits are associated with this position. Employee Group/Grade Casual Job Category Casual /Temporary Casual/Temp Classification Work Schedule Casual (19hrs or less, No Benefits ) Shift/Days Pay Schedule Hour Number of Hrs./Wk. 19 Position Information Position Information Employee's Effective Start Date 06/15/2026 If this is a Temporary position, provide end date or enter N/A for any other position type. n/a Minimum Qualifications 1–2 years of experience in live sports production, broadcast journalism, public address announcing, or related live-event communication roles Strong vocal delivery skills with clear diction, pacing, and audience engagement ability Experience working in high-pressure live event environments with real-time direction Ability to remain focused and professional for 3–5 hour events. Strong communication skills and ability to respond quickly to in-game changes Flexible schedule including evenings, weekends, and occasional holidays Ability to work consistently with athletic event schedules and last-minute changes High energy and engaging personality Strong attention to detail and accuracy under pressure Professional, reliable, and team-oriented approach in live event settings Desired Qualifications Previous experience as a PA announcer or in-arena host Familiarity with collegiate athletics and game flow for sports such as basketball, soccer, volleyball, baseball, and softball Experience working within Division I athletics or similar high-level sports environments Strong understanding of NCAA game structure and in-game timing Experience working with live production teams and in-arena entertainment environments Position Purpose The Public Address (PA) Announcer serves as the voice of Oakland University Athletics during live home athletic events. This role is responsible for delivering clear, energetic, and professional in-game announcements that enhance the fan experience and support game operations across multiple sports. Job Duties Provide live play-by-play style announcements, introductions, and in-game reads for athletic events Deliver accurate roster introductions, scoring updates, promotions, and sponsorship messages Maintain energy, timing, and professionalism throughout games to support atmosphere and engagement Take direction quickly from production and game operations staff via headset or communication systems Collaborate with game operations, marketing, and production teams to ensure smooth event execution Adapt tone and delivery based on sport, event type, and game flow Job Open Date 06/10/2026 Job Close Date Open Until Filled No Position Specific Questions Required fields are indicated with an asterisk (*). Documents Needed to Apply Required Documents Cover Letter Resume Optional Documents 371 Wilson Boulevard, Rochester, MI 48309 248-370-2100     To ensure the security of your data, you will be logged out due to inactivity in 3 minutes at . Any data not saved will be lost. Click 'OK' to keep your session active."
