    "https://jobs.oakland.edu/postings/36851": {
      "title": "Greenskeeper",
      "description": "Oakland University Employment Site | Greenskeeper Skip to Main Content Employment Opportunities Toggle navigation Home Search Jobs Log In /Create Account Help Human Resources Benefits Campus Map Student Employment Greenskeeper Bookmark this Requisition Print Preview | Apply for this Job Posting Details Posting Details Position Title Greenskeeper Department 2465 - Golf Courses Position Number X44256 Requisition No. TC06153 Salary Range/Pay Rate $15-$17/hr; Commensurate with experience Benefits of Working at Oakland University No benefits are associated with this position. Employee Group/Grade Temporary Job Category Casual /Temporary Casual/Temp Classification Work Schedule FT/Temp (40 hours, No Benefits) Shift/Days Available to work a varying schedule including weekdays and weekends. Pay Schedule Hour Number of Hrs./Wk. 40 Position Information Position Information Employee's Effective Start Date 03/06/2026 If this is a Temporary position, provide end date or enter N/A for any other position type. 8 months from date of hire Minimum Qualifications Must be able to perform manual labor tasks for extended periods. Previously experience of lawn maintenance equipment is preferred. Desired Qualifications Position Purpose To assist in the maintenance operation of Oakland University’s 36 hole golfing facility. Job Duties Willing to be trained in multiple maintenance tasks and operation of maintenance equipment. Job Open Date 01/30/2026 Job Close Date Open Until Filled No Position Specific Questions Required fields are indicated with an asterisk (*). Documents Needed to Apply Required Documents Optional Documents Resume 371 Wilson Boulevard, Rochester, MI 48309 248-370-2100     To ensure the security of your data, you will be logged out due to inactivity in 3 minutes at . Any data not saved will be lost. Click 'OK' to keep your session active."
