    "https://jobs.oakland.edu/postings/29976": {
      "title": "PH 5200: Planning, Implementation, and Evaluation of Public Health Interventions",
      "description": "Oakland University Employment Site | PH 5200: Planning, Implementation, and Evaluation of Public Health Interventions Skip to Main Content Employment Opportunities Toggle navigation Home Search Jobs Log In /Create Account Help Human Resources Benefits Campus Map Student Employment PH 5200: Planning, Implementation, and Evaluation of Public Health Interventions Bookmark this Requisition Print Preview | Apply for this Job Position Approval Information First Section School/College: School of Health Sciences Department: 1034 - Public and Environment Wellness Position Title: Lecturer Field of Specialty: Public and Environmental Wellness Name of Department Chair: Caress Dean Expected Hire Date: 01/04/2024 Posting Details Position Information Job Title: PH 5200: Planning, Implementation, and Evaluation of Public Health Interventions Job Description Summary: Oakland University is searching for an Instructor to co-teach a course on the Planning, Implementation, and Evaluation of Public Health Interventions. The lecturer will be required to develop and deliver the assigned course based on the syllabus, address and assess the student learning outcomes stated in the syllabus, and issue timely course grades. This will be in collaboration with the program director and relevant program faculty members to ensure compliance with accreditation competency requirements. The instructor of record will be responsible for adhering to the general terms outlined for lecturers and for following the University guidelines for instruction and grading as stated in the university catalog. Minimum Qualifications: Master’s or Doctoral degree in public health, health behavior, health education or relevant degree. Must be available to teach at Oakland University (Auburn Hills) on Tuesdays from 5:30 pm – 8:50 pm. Special Instructions to Applicants: Oakland University Standard Language Oakland University is a nationally recognized doctoral university of high research activity locat