      "title": "Lecturer - Environmental Health Sciences (PH 5600) - FA23",
      "description": "Oakland University Employment Site | Lecturer - Environmental Health Sciences (PH 5600) - FA23 Skip to Main Content Employment Opportunities Toggle navigation Home Search Jobs Log In /Create Account Help Human Resources Benefits Campus Map Student Employment Lecturer - Environmental Health Sciences (PH 5600) - FA23 Bookmark this Requisition Print Preview | Apply for this Job Position Approval Information First Section School/College: School of Health Sciences Department: 1034 - Public and Environment Wellness Position Title: Lecturer Field of Specialty: Environmental Health Sciences Name of Department Chair: Rebecca Cheezum Expected Hire Date: 09/05/2023 Posting Details Position Information Job Title: Lecturer - Environmental Health Sciences (PH 5600) - FA23 Job Description Summary: Oakland University is searching for an Instructor to teach a course on environmental health sciences for master of public health students. The lecturer will be required to develop and deliver the assigned course based on the syllabus, address and assess the student learning outcomes stated in the syllabus, and issue timely course grades. This will be in collaboration with the program director and relevant program faculty to ensure compliance with accreditation competency requirements. The instructor of record will be responsible for adhering to the general terms outlined for lecturers and for following the University guidelines for instruction and grading as stated in the university catalog. Minimum Qualifications: Master’s or Doctoral degree in environmental health, environmental sciences, or related field. Special Instructions to Applicants: Oakland University Standard Language Oakland University is a nationally recognized doctoral university of high research activity located on 1,443 acres of scenic land in the cities of Rochester Hills and Auburn Hills in Oakland County, Michigan. The University has 142 bachelor’s degree programs and 138 graduate degree and cert